# THE VIEW OVER THE SHOULDER (owner, 2026-09-23: "switch to true third person
# perspective (see from behind the players shoulder) ... seamless just like
# targeting ... a key that player has to hold down ... see parts of the sky and
# the horizon"). src/systems/41_shoulder.gd, CameraRig, src/core/view/shoulder.gd.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/shoulder.tour --seed=4 --hour=12 --weather=clear:0
#
# What it proves, from a normal game start, through the real key and a staged
# mouse: the land from above; the key held and the camera gliding down off its
# perch (frames taken WHILE it glides, so a pop would be in them); over the
# shoulder with the sky in the frame; walking where the camera looks; the mouse
# turning it and tipping it up; a machine locked with Z framed over the
# shoulder; the shoulder let go while Z is still held landing on the lock's lens;
# both let go, the land again. Then noon, dusk and night over the shoulder on
# the coast and in a second landscape, and at dusk turned to face the sun, whose
# shadows at eye level fall back toward the eye (the light stands where the sky
# draws the sun). tests/camera/test_shoulder.gd measures the
# glide frame by frame; these are what it looks like.
coast calm
wait 0.9
await top_view 2
shot 01-the-land-from-above

hold shoulder
shot 02-the-key-down-gliding with shoulder_gliding
await shoulder 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-over-the-shoulder-noon with shoulder,sky_in_frame

walk 0,-1 1.6
shot 04-walked-where-the-camera-looks with shoulder

mouse 520,0 0.6
await shoulder_turned 2
wait 0.3
shot 05-turned-by-the-mouse with shoulder_turned
mouse 0,-190 0.4
wait 0.2
shot 06-tipped-up-to-the-sky with shoulder,sky_in_frame
mouse 0,190 0.4

spawn runner
wait 0.6
hold target
await target 5
await shoulder_locked 3
wait 0.4
shot 07-a-runner-locked-over-the-shoulder with mob:runner,shoulder_locked

release shoulder
await top_view 3
await target_lens 3
wait 0.6
shot 08-shoulder-let-go-the-lock-lens with mob:runner,target_lens

release target
await target_flat 3
wait 1.0
shot 09-both-let-go-the-land-again with top_view
coast calm

hold shoulder
await shoulder 3
hour 18.6
wait 1.2
shot 10-dusk-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
try 40
mouse 60,0 0.05
await shoulder_sun 0.1
end
wait 0.4
shot 10b-dusk-facing-the-sun with shoulder_sun
hour 23
wait 1.2
shot 11-night-over-the-shoulder with shoulder
release shoulder
await top_view 3

place pinewood
hour 12
wait 1.5
hold shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 12-pinewood-noon-over-the-shoulder with shoulder,land:pinewood
hour 18.6
wait 1.2
shot 13-pinewood-dusk-over-the-shoulder with shoulder,land:pinewood
hour 23
wait 1.2
shot 14-pinewood-night-over-the-shoulder with shoulder,land:pinewood
release shoulder
await top_view 3
